<p style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;">Thank you for your interest in the role! We're excited to let you know that your profile has been shortlisted, and you're moving forward to the next step in our hiring process.</p>
<p style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;">As part of the next stage, you'll be meeting with <strong>[hiring_manager_names]</strong>, our client at <strong>Propertywise AU Pty Ltd</strong>. This meeting will provide both you and the client an opportunity to learn more about each other and align on expectations. Please find the Zoom meeting link below:</p>
