<p style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Friendly Reminders:</strong></p>
<ul style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.38;color:#000000;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:16px;padding-left:22px;">
<li style="margin-bottom:8px;">Kindly <strong>connect 10 minutes early</strong> to make sure your camera and microphone are working properly.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:8px;">Use your laptop or PC for this interview.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:8px;">Make sure that your <strong>Full Name</strong> and the <strong>role</strong> you are interviewing for are reflected in the Zoom meeting.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:8px;">Kindly ensure that you are <strong>presentable and appropriately dressed</strong> for the meeting.</li>
